# Sample .gitignore for .booth/shared/home/coder/.chrome-data/Default/
# Copy next to Bookmarks when committing team browser state.
# Prefer +bookmarks-shared / +settings-shared / +extensions-shared (shared only — not cache).

*
!.gitignore
!.mount-this
!Bookmarks
!Bookmarks.bak
!Preferences
!Secure Preferences
!Extensions/
!Extensions/**
